<div class="container-fluid min-vh-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"
     style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6a11cb 0%, #2575fc 100%);">
  <div class="text-center text-white p-5 rounded-4 shadow-lg" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);">
    <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold mb-3">🎉 Bienvenido al Sistema de Gestión de Eventos 🎉</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-4">Seleccioná una opción en el menú lateral para comenzar y administrar tus eventos fácilmente.</p>
    <div class="row g-3 justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
        <a href="<%= asignaciones_path %>" class="btn btn-gradient btn-lg w-100 py-3" style="background: #ff416c; background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff4b2b, #ff416c); color: white; font-weight: bold;">
          <i class="bi bi-list-check me-2"></i> Asignaciones
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
        <a href="<%= empleados_path %>" class="btn btn-gradient btn-lg w-100 py-3" style="background: #11998e; background: linear-gradient(to right, #38ef7d, #11998e); color: white; font-weight: bold;">
          <i class="bi bi-people-fill me-2"></i> Empleados
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
        <a href="<%= eventos_path %>" class="btn btn-gradient btn-lg w-100 py-3" style="background: #fc4a1a; background: linear-gradient(to right, #f7b733, #fc4a1a); color: white; font-weight: bold;">
          <i class="bi bi-calendar-event-fill me-2"></i> Eventos
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


